al backoff (2ⁿ mins, capped at 120), achieving a 73% reduction in API calls. Encrypted API keys in scheduler payloads, auto-deletes rules on job completion. Fully provider-agnostic abstraction under 200 lines of TypeScript.</p>"}},{"node":{"frontmatter":{"title":"Comergent Content Agent","cover":{"childImageSharp":{"gatsbyImageData":{"layout":"constrained","placeholder":{"fallback":"data:image/png;base64,"},"images":{"fallback":{"src":"/portfolio-v2/static/e270729efa1b4199eb3394d08b2fc4ca/e290a/content-agent.png","srcSet":"/portfolio-v2/static/e270729efa1b4199eb3394d08b2fc4ca/a4d46/content-agent.png 175w,\n/portfolio-v2/static/e270729efa1b4199eb3394d08b2fc4ca/ce7ae/content-agent.png 350w,\n/portfolio-v2/static/e270729efa1b4199eb3394d08b2fc4ca/e290a/content-agent.png 700w,\n/portfolio-v2/static/e270729efa1b4199eb3394d08b2fc4ca/203f1/content-agent.png 1400w","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"},"sources":[{"srcSet":"/portfolio-v2/static/e270729efa1b4199eb3394d08b2fc4ca/19d98/content-agent.avif 175w,\n/portfolio-v2/static/e270729efa1b4199eb3394d08b2fc4ca/e0303/content-agent.avif 350w,\n/portfolio-v2/static/e270729efa1b4199eb3394d08b2fc4ca/bb74c/content-agent.avif 700w,\n/portfolio-v2/static/e270729efa1b4199eb3394d08b2fc4ca/02b0c/content-agent.avif 1400w","type":"image/avif","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"},{"srcSet":"/portfolio-v2/static/e270729efa1b4199eb3394d08b2fc4ca/eac4f/content-agent.webp 175w,\n/portfolio-v2/static/e270729efa1b4199eb3394d08b2fc4ca/f1df2/content-agent.webp 350w,\n/portfolio-v2/static/e270729efa1b4199eb3394d08b2fc4ca/76c39/content-agent.webp 700w,\n/portfolio-v2/static/e270729efa1b4199eb3394d08b2fc4ca/5502a/content-agent.webp 1400w","type":"image/webp","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"}]},"width":700,"height":354}}},"tech":["Python","LangGraph","FastAPI","Anthropic Claude","OpenAI","Pinecone","asyncio"],"github":null,"external":"https://comergent.ai/","cta":""},"html":"<p>Multi-store LLM orchestration agent scaling content 